---
title: "Acme Speech-to-Text"
sidebarTitle: "Acme"
description: "AcmeSTTService transcribes audio with Acme's streaming STT API."
---

```python
from pipecat.services.acme.stt import AcmeSTTService
```

## Configuration

<ParamField path="api_key" type="str" required>
  Acme API key.
</ParamField>

<ParamField path="settings" type="AcmeSTTService.Settings" default="None">
  Runtime-configurable settings.
</ParamField>

### Settings

| Parameter   | Type              | Default        | Description                                                       |
| ----------- | ----------------- | -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `model`     | `str`             | `"acme-stt-1"` | Model.                                                            |
| `language`  | `Language \| str` | `"en"`         | Not a default-mismatch: `__init__` fills it in when left unset.   |
| `punctuate` | `bool`            | `True`         | Punctuate transcripts.                                            |
